# "from your graveyard": Bot2's Ornithopter is put into Bot2's graveyard by Bot1's Cut Down, so Bot1 has no creature card
# in its own graveyard and Helping Hand cannot be cast, though a creature card sits in a graveyard (CR 115.1, 601.2c).
# Faithless Looting then discards Hired Blade and the same cast is offered, the positive control; it returns Hired
# Blade, tapped, and Ornithopter stays in Bot2's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Cut Down
Hired Blade
Faithless Looting
Helping Hand
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cut Down.Cast(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Hand.Helping Hand.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Hired Blade; Plains)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Helping Hand.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Hired Blade)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Hired Blade.Tapped = true
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
